      (value "HUB_PV input (part TODO(unverified))")
      (fields
        (field (name "Footprint"))
        (field (name "Datasheet"))
        (field (name "Description")))
      (libsource (lib "balloon_flight_v9") (part "HUB_CONVERTER") (description "The hub array's OWN converter / harvester input (ADR-051 s2.1 decision 1 - the hub string is never in series with, and never a tap on, the wing chain). Pin 1 = PV_P (HUB_PV_P), pin 2 = GND (the ONE node this string may share with the wing system), pin 3 = PV_N (HUB_PV_N). The chosen part is OPEN: ADR-051 s2.2 recommends a 2-cell H2 string on a sub-uA harvester (bq25570 class) but the H2/H3 vs M5/M6 fork and the harvester's peak-input rating are unresolved (ADR-051 s4 items 3/5/6, OPEN-26)."))
